Z||000000||count_iblis||11-14-2000||02:42 PM||||Since Im going to install a 3.4 in the gt i have I guess this will be the best time to think about some mods on the engine.  What can be dont to make it faster?  <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/count-sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Black88GT||11-14-2000||03:28 PM||||On the forum, there is a search function.  Since many, if not all topics concerning the 3.4 have been talked about extensively in the past, you will have to use the search function to find your answers on the 3.4<P><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/cartmanico.gif">           <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kennyico.gif">         <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/stanico.gif">       <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kyleico.gif">           <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/chefico.gif"> ||||reg||1
